+    A left-positioned bar means 'L': rotate 90 degrees counterclockwise.
+    A right-positioned bar means 'D': take the 45-degree diagonal-toggle bend.
+    """
+    legend = grid[:legend_h, :]
+    assert legend.size, "legend must be non-empty"
